    "evidence": "The oversized “One residual evidence gap.” headline, numbered evidence-gap dossier, restrained cyan/crimson/amber accents, and technical typography create a coherent defense-lab identity across all three viewports. However, the core presentation remains a familiar dark dashboard of bordered cards, labels, and a CTA; there is no singular visual metaphor or demonstrated interaction that makes the unknown/evidence-gap concept unforgettable.",
